# Staging production mode

The published origin (`urantia.uklok.cloud` → `localhost:8080`) is staging.
Leave every module in production mode at the end of the turn so phone and
review traffic hit `next start` / `bun start`, not hot reload.

## End of every turn

1. In this repo, leave the stack running: `make up` (default `MODE=prod`).
2. Hub command is `yarn build && yarn start`. API command is `bun run start`.
   Caddy on `:8080` is the only published ingress.
3. Run `make verify`. Do not `make down` and do not kill the modules.
4. `make dev-up` (`MODE=dev`) is only for an in-turn edit that needs
   `yarn dev` / `bun --hot` or diagnostic host ports. Flip back to
   `make up` before you finish.

Do not point the Cloudflare tunnel at hub or API host ports.
